<title>SWEDEN: Volvo Bus to expand Chinese output.</title>
<headline>Volvo Bus to expand Chinese output.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo said on Friday its bus division would expand its manufacturing capacity in China by 1,000 buses per year.  </p>
<p>Volvo said in a statement it had cooperated with the Xian Silver Bus Corporation since 1994 in a plant which has a current capacity of 400 buses per year.</p>
<p>&quot;On the basis of the rapid and successful development of the joint venture activities, it has been decided to build a new, parallel factory with a capacity of 1,000 units,&quot; Volvo said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
